3]（10s-15s）中近景，马尔斯向希达伸出手，目光坚定，希达眼神湿润抬头看他。马尔斯开口：(S1) 说：<d>[Chinese]走吧，一起去塔利斯城。</d>镜头缓缓推进至两人对视。\n\n全程保持角色关系：马尔斯始终位于画面左侧或中央偏左，希达位于右侧；希达的深蓝长发、粉披风，马尔斯的金冠蓝甲全程连续。绝对禁止字幕、画面文字、LOGO、水印。\n\noverall_soundscape:\n城堡内脚步回声、盔甲轻响、窗外隐约的海风与远处喊杀声。\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低沉弦乐与战鼓渐起，庄重紧迫，随马尔斯决意出征收束。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [811.9644775390625, 403.9906311035156], "pos": [-4008.053466796875, 5059.2451171875], "id": 232, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [485], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314], "pos": [-1468.354248046875, 6394.7841796875], "widgets_values": ["example.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 254, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [483], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [274.080078125, 314], "pos": [-2080.64697265625, 5741.9326171875], "widgets_values": ["example.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "